      "title": {
        "en": "Skilled and attentive styling professionals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents regularly celebrate head groomer Elsie and her team for their professionalism, warmth, and artistic grooming skills. Reviewers appreciate that the staff provide helpful coat maintenance advice without sales pressure. Aside from one critical complaint regarding pricing and service duration, the vast majority describe an exceptional and friendly crew."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "en": "Outstanding breed trims and hand stripping"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog and cat owners consistently express admiration for the styling outcomes, noting that pets return polished, super clean, and smelling great. Clients specifically praise the salon's expertise in breed-specific cuts and hand stripping for terriers, with groomers sharing photos during appointments to ensure satisfaction."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for nervous and senior pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize that animals are handled with kindness and gentle care, allowing timid rescues, young puppies, and senior dogs to feel calm throughout their appointments. Cat owners also appreciate successful nail trims and baths for felines that normally require sedation elsewhere."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
